[i]中文说明见下方[/i]

[h1]Probably Not Human[/h1]
Let an AI agent run your shop.

This mod exposes the game state and every player action to AI agents like Claude Code, Codex or Cursor, so they can play the game on their own: call customers, appraise, haggle, buy and sell, scavenge at night, pay the rent.

[b]The mod does nothing by itself.[/b] You also need the companion client (free and open source) and an AI tool of your own:
[url={repo_url}]{repo_url}[/url]

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]74 actions covering the whole game: day cycle, customers and dialogue, trading and bargaining, items and tools, night trips, phone, saves
[*]Full game state as JSON: items and their real values, inventories, customers and budgets, bargain odds, calendar, news, documents
[*]Wait conditions (customer ready, dialogue finished, day 12, ...), so the agent doesn't have to sleep or poll
[*]Screenshots and virtual mouse/keyboard input for anything without a dedicated action
[*]Works with any MCP client, and can also be used from the command line or as a Python library
[*]Runs locally. The mod has no network access and needs no mod permissions
[/list]

[h2]Requirements[/h2]
[list]
[*]Python 3.10+
[*]An MCP client such as Claude Code, Codex, Claude Desktop or Cursor, or any agent that can run shell commands
[/list]

[h2]Installation[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe, open [b]Mods[/b] in the game, activate [b]Probably Not Human[/b] and restart the game.
[*]Install the client:
[code]pip install {repo_url}/archive/refs/heads/main.zip[/code]
[*]Start the game and check that the client can reach it:
[code]probably-not-human health[/code]
[*]Add the MCP server to your client. For Claude Code:
[code]claude mcp add probably-stolen -- probably-not-human mcp[/code]
[*]Ask your agent to play.
[/olist]
Config for other clients and troubleshooting are in the repository.

[h2]Notes[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]The agent plays on your real save.[/b] It spends money, sells your stock and saves the game. Use a spare save slot.
[*]The agent sees more than a player does. Real item values, customer budgets and bargain odds are all included.
[*]The mod contains no strategy and gives the agent no hints. How well it plays depends on the model.
[*]The client and the mod talk through files in the game's ModData folder. Other programs on your PC can read and write that folder too while the mod is active.
[*]Tested on 1.0.0 (100-Rev13), Windows. A game update may break the mod until it is updated.
[/list]

Source code, documentation and bug reports: [url={repo_url}]{repo_url}[/url]

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Probably Not Human[/h1]
让 AI 帮你看店。

这个模组把游戏状态和玩家的所有操作开放给 Claude Code、Codex、Cursor 这类 AI 工具，让它们自己玩游戏：叫客、鉴定、砍价、买卖、半夜出门拾荒、交房租。

[b]只装模组是没有效果的。[/b]还需要安装配套的客户端（免费开源），并且自备一个 AI 工具：
[url={repo_url}]{repo_url}[/url]

[h2]功能[/h2]
[list]
[*]74 个操作，覆盖整个游戏流程：开店关店、叫客对话、交易砍价、物品和工具、夜间外出、电话、存读档
[*]游戏状态以 JSON 返回：物品及其真实价值、所有库存、顾客和预算、砍价成功率、日历、新闻、各种文档的内容
[*]支持按条件等待（顾客到了、对话结束、到第 12 天……），不用 sleep，也不用轮询
[*]没有专门操作的地方，可以用截图加模拟键鼠
[*]支持所有 MCP 客户端，也可以用命令行，或者当 Python 库来用
[*]纯本地运行，模组不联网，也不需要任何模组权限
[/list]

[h2]环境要求[/h2]
[list]
[*]Python 3.10+
[*]支持 MCP 的 AI 客户端，比如 Claude Code、Codex、Claude Desktop、Cursor；或者任何能执行命令行的 AI 工具
[/list]

[h2]安装[/h2]
[olist]
[*]订阅后进游戏打开「改装件」，激活 [b]Probably Not Human[/b]，然后重启游戏。
[*]安装客户端：
[code]pip install {repo_url}/archive/refs/heads/main.zip[/code]
[*]启动游戏，检查能不能连上：
[code]probably-not-human health[/code]
[*]在 AI 客户端里添加 MCP Server。以 Claude Code 为例：
[code]claude mcp add probably-stolen -- probably-not-human mcp[/code]
[*]让 AI 开玩。
[/olist]
其他客户端的配置方法和常见问题见仓库。

[h2]注意事项[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]AI 是在你的真存档上玩的。[/b]会花钱、会卖货、会存档。建议专门给它留一个存档位。
[*]AI 能看到的信息比玩家多，物品真实价值、顾客预算、砍价成功率都在里面。
[*]模组本身不带任何策略，也不会给 AI 提示，玩得好不好全看模型。
[*]客户端和模组通过游戏 ModData 目录下的文件通信。模组启用期间，电脑上的其他程序也能读写这个目录。
[*]在 1.0.0（100-Rev13）Windows 版上测试。游戏更新后模组可能会失效，需要等模组更新。
[/list]

源码、文档和问题反馈：[url={repo_url}]{repo_url}[/url]
